# DOT & DASH: the fourth size. With the second tonic Dot shrinks once more
# inside the micro world, in the same place, small enough for a gap one tile
# high: some treasures wait in nooks behind such gaps. Here the grip mitt in
# the dust under the bookshelf: out of reach at micro size, and in reach
# when tiny. Tiny, she can't grow back up under a low ceiling.
game dotdash
wait 5
cheat newgame
cheat no_foes
cheat nodash
cheat god
cheat up tonic1
cheat micro 0 80 131 4
wait 5
expect scale == 2
expect place_x.gap:131 >= 0
expect reachplace.gap:131 == 0
# the second tonic: smaller still
cheat up tonic2
cheat skip_dialog
wait 5
hold DOWN 100
waituntil trans == 0 60
expect scale == 3
expect body_h == 6
expect depth == 1
expect reachplace.gap:131 == 1
cheat bot_to gap:131
botuntil bot_state == 2 6000
# in the nook: no room to grow
hold UP 100
wait 20
expect scale == 3
# the mitt lies loose in there (no room to lift a box): it's hers
waituntil up.mitt1 == 1 60
expect up.mitt1 == 1
# and out again, and back up to micro size
hold LEFT 60
wait 10
hold UP 100
waituntil trans == 0 60
expect scale == 2
